                                "sense_id": "a083eb15-11b2-33dc-bb97-b393fd5a7f9d",
                                "text": "Da lag er, sein Monogramm auf der Brusttasche seines Nachthemds, die Hände hinter dem Kopf gefaltet, in seinem reinlichen, weißen Bett,[…] die Sonderbarkeit seiner Lebenslage betrachtend.",
                                "translation": "There he lay, his monogram on his nightgown's chest pocket, his hands folded behind his head, in his cleanly, white bed […] , looking on how curious his situation was.",
